# Markdown: Edit / Preview subtabs (run by tests/t_ui.sh).
open README.md
key ctrl+shift+v
wait 50
key PageDown End Home
key ctrl+shift+v
expect file README.md
expect line 1
key ctrl+End
type \n- new item
key ctrl+shift+v
wait 50
type ignored
key ctrl+shift+v
expect text - new item
key ctrl+s
open odd.md
key ctrl+shift+v
wait 50
key End
key ctrl+shift+v
